,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504897012,"data":"WHY I OVERSTATED THE DELIVERY\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.5049057,"data":"======================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504913558,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504916380000001,"data":"  #1 Keyword matching instead of requirement matching\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504919351,"data":"     Example: Saw 'weapons' → downloaded blasters. Plan says 'survival melee/ranged/improvised'. Blasters are sci-fi.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504923303,"data":"     New rule: Match against PLAN REQUIREMENTS, not search keywords.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504926075,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504928615,"data":"  #2 Counting files instead of counting matches\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504931314,"data":"     Example: 50 car models ≠ 50 plan-matching vehicles. 3/8 types matched = 37.5%, not 100%.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504941172,"data":"     New rule: Express coverage as: (matched_plan_types / total_plan_types), not (files_downloaded / anything).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504944074,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.50494659,"data":"  #3 Not checking format compatibility\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504949343,"data":"     Example: FBX+Blend downloaded for Three.js pipeline that needs GLB. Format gap unmentioned.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504952181,"data":"     New rule: Verify: target_engine_required_format ∈ delivered_formats.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.50495794,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504960613,"data":"  #4 Equating GOVERNOR completion with overall completion\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504963437,"data":"     Example: State machines valid → 'CP2 COMPLETE'. But visual models are 2KB boxes.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504966239,"data":"     New rule: Report GOVERNOR and GAUGE status separately. Don't merge them.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504969017,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504971643,"data":"  #5 Downloading before verifying plan match\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504974405,"data":"     Example: Downloaded 730+ files. Only ~100 are plan-usable. Noise ratio: 7.3x.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.504977202,"data":"     New rule: Verify plan match BEFORE bulk download. One matched asset \u003e 100 unmatched.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":11.520832581,"data":"======================================================================\n"}
